# {{ project_name }}

FastAPI project with clean architecture.

## Requirements

- Python 3.11+
- [UV](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/) package manager
- Docker & Docker Compose (optional)

## Getting Started

### 1. Install dependencies

```bash
uv sync
```

### 2. Configure environment

```bash
cp .env.example .env
# Edit .env with your configuration
```

### 3. Start database

{% if docker != "none" %}
```bash
docker compose -f docker-compose.dev.yml up -d
```
{% else %}
Configure your database connection in `.env` file.
{% endif %}

### 4. Run migrations

```bash
uv run alembic upgrade head
```

### 5. Start development server

```bash
uv run uvicorn src.{{ package_name }}.api.main:app --reload
```

The API will be available at `http://localhost:8000`.

## Project Structure

```
src/{{ package_name }}/
├── api/                 # API layer (FastAPI routes, schemas)
│   ├── dependencies/    # Dependency injection
│   ├── routes/          # API endpoints
│   └── schemas/         # Pydantic schemas for API
├── application/         # Application layer (use cases, DTOs)
│   ├── dtos/            # Data Transfer Objects
│   └── use_cases/       # Business use cases
├── domain/              # Domain layer (entities, repositories)
│   ├── entities/        # Domain entities
│   ├── exceptions/      # Domain exceptions
│   └── repositories/    # Repository interfaces (Protocols)
└── infrastructure/      # Infrastructure layer (implementations)
    ├── orm/             # SQLAlchemy models and session
    └── repositories/    # Repository implementations
```

## Development

### Run tests

```bash
uv run pytest
```

### Run linter

```bash
uv run ruff check .
uv run ruff format .
```

{% if precommit %}
### Pre-commit hooks

```bash
uv run pre-commit install
uv run pre-commit run --all-files
```
{% endif %}

