## Database

- **Type**: {{ database | capitalize }}
- **Migrations**: Alembic

### Create a new migration

```bash
uv run alembic revision --autogenerate -m "description"
```

### Apply migrations

```bash
uv run alembic upgrade head
```

### Rollback migration

```bash
uv run alembic downgrade -1
```
